# Staging build environment — used when Vite builds the frontend for the
# staging deploy. Baked at build time; never contains secrets. See plan TASK-003.
#
# No API URL is needed: the frontend reaches the API same-origin (the frontend
# asset worker forwards /api/* to classprints-api via a service binding), so
# auth cookies are first-party and sessions survive a page refresh. Do NOT bake
# a cross-origin API URL (e.g. https://classprints-api.<sub>.workers.dev) — the
# browser would store session cookies on the API origin, where the app can
# neither read nor resend them, logging users out on every refresh.
